  "prefLabel": "Ch 103.06 Public Attendance at Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ch 103.06 Public Attendance at Meetings. Pursuant to RSA 91-A, members of the public shall have the right to attend and record all board meetings which are public sessions and not authorized by RSA 91-A:3, II to be closed to the public.\n\nSource. #7516, eff 6-27-01; ss by #14499, eff 3-1-26 (formerly Ch 103.07)",
